<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;P&gt;
Using the core Perl module [metamod://Time::Piece] (which overrides the built-in functions &lt;c&gt;localtime&lt;/c&gt; and &lt;c&gt;gmtime&lt;/c&gt;, providing functions that return objects):
&lt;BLOCKQUOTE&gt;
&lt;c&gt;use Time::Piece;&lt;/c&gt;&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;c&gt;print gmtime-&gt;wday;&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
